    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazer is a puzzle game where you have to find a way through a maze while following rules of every element you encounter. <strong>With 150 handcrafted puzzles of varying difficulty, each level will test your logic to its limits!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Find a path through the maze while obeying the rules of stars, shapes, geometric figures, and other elements. <br>\ud83c\udf1f Each element has its own unique behavior \u2013 find out how they interact to solve the puzzle! <br>\ud83d\udca1Learn the game through a dedicated in-game &quot;How to play?&quot; tutorial and starter puzzles set. <br>\ud83e\udde0 Levels increase in difficulty, keeping you engaged and challenged. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 150 mind-bending unique puzzles <br>\u2714 Simple controls, smooth gameplay, and deep logic-based gameplay <br>\u2714 No timers, no stress \u2013 play at your own pace <br>\u2714 Perfect for puzzle lovers looking for a fresh challenge <br> <br><strong>Can you solve all of the mazes?</strong> Try Mazer now and put your logic to the test!</p>",
